, "call_id": "toolu_018KjWqCpWtvaFEzTganN6bQ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57409, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018KjWqCpWtvaFEzTganN6bQ", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 59389, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RtwaGgundSSxR93Gf8W9Au", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 59689, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RtwaGgundSSxR93Gf8W9Au", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 59689, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RtwaGgundSSxR93Gf8W9Au", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 64946, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. Both later versions, v2.3.1 and its release candidate v2.3.1-rc, were marked unhealthy. My first rollback attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error, leaving only us-east on v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1. I retried once and that finished the job. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy and the error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The create request timed out, so I checked the incident list before trying again. The incident had already been created, so I didn't send it a second time and page on-call twice. INC-0001 is SEV2 and describes the failure, the rollback, the stalled first attempt and next steps.\n\nTwo things still need follow-up: finding why v2.3.1 failed, and looking into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_013RJadbsL5NhrYSzCSNcDJQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012xQjyTvvyGXAKiErs9aCKv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1). The two later entries, v2.3.1-rc (seq 2) and v2.3.1 (seq 3), are both unhealthy. Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0128MdKHPnTi6bkEwMRGHhQx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01E5bGfPa8fwpJFvXpbB14bq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only finished in us-east. I'll retry once to finish the other regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01KELWnmgeCZyrMJg26jsCnS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Dq4ZLpg9N7GPzateyXFPqQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Wzjz2AY15bvb2WpZ72zsVo"